  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_615275_(Neo-)Forge.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon-fabric\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_838803_Fabric.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Curseforge\"></a> \n  <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/lexicon\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/lexicon?logo=modrinth&label=&suffix=%20&style=flat&color=242629&labelColor=5ca424&logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/615275(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"Поддерживаемые версии\"></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&logo=discord&style=flat&label=&labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a>\n</p>\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Lexicon/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"логотип\" width=\"400\"/><br>\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"линия\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n\n## 📖 Описание\n\nЭтот мод добавляет в игру лексикон, который объясняет практически каждый аспект Minecraft!\nОт вашей первой ночи через описания всех мобов, схемы редстоуна, советы, трюки, зельеварение, зачарование, команды и до прохождения игры!\n\nБудет полезно всем новичкам и игрокам, которые хотят расширить свои знания об игре, не обращаясь постоянно к интернету..\n\n -----\n\n### Особенности:\n\n- внутриигровая энциклопедия\n- основан на [Patchouli](https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli)\n- проверка обновлений\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"линия\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 📷 Галерея\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/EHckbE2.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/SQHv9XD.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/4mrqFRm.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/k0mzncT.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/ErHi32t.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/j1D6xsJ.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/ovz9Udb.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/lCySCJo.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/yKNXhKM.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/9MdwsIx.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/ByxM5ph.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/2apkK7R.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/JCDPLnY.png)\n\n![](https://i.imgur.com/6gBIZEw.png)\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"линия\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 🗃️ Зависимости\n\n### Обязательные:\n\n- **Magma Core** [≥ MC 1.21.5]\n  - Предоставляет базовый код и функции, такие как проверка обновлений\n  - [CurseForge][cf_magmacore] | [Modrinth][mr_magmacore]\n\n- **GuideME** [≥ MC 1.21.5]\n    - Предоставляет основу для лексикона\n    - [CurseForge][cf_guideme] | [Modrinth][mr_guideme]\n\n- **Patchouli** [≤ MC 1.21.4]\n  - Предоставляет основу для лексикона\n  - [CurseForge][cf_patchouli] | [Modrinth][mr_patchouli]\n\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"линия\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n## 🎮 Другие мои моды!\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Additional-Structures/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Дополнительные структуры\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bedrock-miner\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Bedrock-Miner/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Шахтёр бедрока\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tool-upgrades\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ToolUpgrades/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Улучшения инструментов\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/all-the-compatibility\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AllTheCompatibility/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Полная совместимость\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/customized-dungeon-loot\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/2291f5f13114f09294ce5e079f8a61b8a2617a8692e68ca453674e93f1982b62/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f427065525748442e706e67\" alt=\"Кастомный лут из подземелий\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/advanced-sticks\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/AdvancedSticks/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Продвинутые палки\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/age-of-weapons\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/e8e1315b08a3bd1fb144ccd47488b1df4033418ad3aee01e61cc9d6e83fa55a5/68747470733a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f586d324332576a2e706e67\" alt=\"Эпоха оружия\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/RuneCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Руническая мастерская\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collectibles\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Collectibles/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Коллекционные предметы\" width=\"85\"/></a> <br> \n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-gems\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExtraGems/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Дополнительные драгоценности\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/minetraps\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/MineTraps/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Минные ловушки\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/exo-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/ExoCraft/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Экзокрафт\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/city-craft\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/CityCraft/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Городской крафт\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/upcycle\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Upcycle/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Переработка\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lexicon\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Lexicon/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Лексикон\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/nexus-battle-mode\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Nexus/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Режим битвы Nexus\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/block-detective\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/BlockDetective/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Детектив блоков\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/suspicious-pots\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/Suspicious-Pots/blob/main/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Подозрительные горшки\" width=\"85\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"линия\" width=\"2000\"/>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<br>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/message.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Написать сообщение\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/github_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"GitHub\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://ko-fi.com/xxrexraptorxx\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/kofi_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Ko-fi\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/bePatron?u=75131568\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/patreon_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/ycRJJk8EXV\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/discord_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://x.com/XxRexRaptorxX\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/xtwitter_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"X\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/FAQ.md\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/icons/wikipedia_icon_bg.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Часто задаваемые вопросы\" width=\"70\"/></a>\n<br> <br>\n  <a href=\"https://bisecthosting.com/REXRAPTOR\"><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/BH_REX_Bisect.png?raw=true\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting - скидка 25% по коду: REXRAPTOR\"/></a>\n</p>\n\n[cf_magmacore]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/magma-core\n[mr_magmacore]: https://modrinth.com/mod/magma-core\n[cf_patchouli]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\n[mr_patchouli]: https://modrinth.com/mods/patchouli\n[cf_guideME]: https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/guideme\n[mr_guideME]: https://modrinth.com/mod/guideme",
